    "teach_5": {
      "id": "teach_5",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Two separate measured legs can reveal the current with almost no algebra.\n\n15 km downstream in 3 h 45 min gives 4 km/hr.\n5 km upstream in 2 h 30 min gives 2 km/hr.",
