      "content": {
        "text": "Now use half-difference:\n\nCurrent = (4−2)/2 = 1 km/hr.\nStill water = (4+2)/2 = 3 km/hr.\n\nThe time conversion is the only hidden step.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
